# 8ALL – Multi‑Path Space

8ALL is a neutral space where a system can show more than one path at the same time.  
While 4ALL offers a single open area, 8ALL expands it and makes parallel paths visible.  
8ALL represents the idea that “a system does not need to move in only one direction.”

ASCII Forms:

●────●────●  
1D: Multi‑connection line.

●────●────●  
│    │    │  
●────●────●  
2D: Wide surface, parallel area.

     ●────●────●  
    /    /│    /│  
  ●────● │ ●────●  
  │    │ ● │    │  
  │    │/  │    │/  
  ●────●────●────●  
3D: Multi‑volume, multi‑direction.

8ALL provides:
- parallel paths  
- multiple starting points  
- expanded neutral space  
- visible multi‑structure  
- pure form without internals  

8ALL today:
A space that removes the “single‑path” limitation.  
A calm, structured, multi‑directional area that can hold several options at once.

